WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
(upbeat Latin music)

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.590
- [Narrator] Colombia,
land of flavor and color.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.860
But, few know about the incredibly rich

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.433
and unusual fruits this
country has to offer.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:14.570
Thanks to its biodiversity,
the land produces delicacies,

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.720
like the prehistoric looking guanábana

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.333
and the mysterious mangostino.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.010
And that brings us here.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.903
This is not your typical
grocery store produce section.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.083
This is Paloquemao.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.960
Welcome to Bogotá's quintessential market.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.720
This is the place to find
the most mysterious-looking,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.193
strange-flavored fruits
across the palette.

00:00:40.937 --> 00:00:44.604
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:10.034 --> 00:01:11.302
(upbeat Latin music)

00:01:11.302 --> 00:01:14.969
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:39.084 --> 00:01:41.334
(laughing)

00:01:45.645 --> 00:01:49.267
(upbeat Latin music)

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:52.934
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:11.660
- [Narrator] Paloquemao
is a special place,

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:13.620
bursting with color and flavor,

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.520
offering the world an irreplaceable

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:17.900
array of nectarous gifts.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.003
Of course, as long as they're in season.

00:02:25.865 --> 00:02:28.782
(electronic music)

